      "message": "Yep, It\u0027ll make sure you don\u0027t get this race condition:\n\n2017-09-14 23:59:58\n2017-09-14 23:59:59\nrtc-\u003ertc_ssr \u003d STM32_RTC_SSR //whatever that is\nwhile (rtc-\u003ertc_ssr !\u003d STM32_RTC_SSR); // check succeeds, so we continue\nrtc-\u003ertc_tr \u003d STM32_RTC_TR // 23:59:59\nwhile (rtc-\u003ertc_tr !\u003d STM32_RTC_TR); // check succeeds so we continue\nrtc-\u003ertc_dr \u003d STM32_RTC_DR; //2017-09-14 \n2017-09-15 00:00:00\nwhile (rtc-\u003ertc_dr !\u003d STM32_RTC_DR); // check fails\nrtc-\u003ertc_dr \u003d STM32_RTC_DR; //2017-09-15 \nwhile (rtc-\u003ertc_dr !\u003d STM32_RTC_DR); // check succeeds so we continue\n2017-09-15 00:00:01\n\nrtc_read now returns the date as 2017-09-15 23:59:59",
